      "sourceTextSha256": "735ced01c00ed3efa8bca108ed6f5e2becef695d341abc232fd2a16d83c5bd79",
      "text": "After breakfast at hotel you will go on a Tropical Islands trip. Enjoy a wonderful full day tour at Angra dos Reis and Ilha Grande on a boat. Your driver will pick you up at your hotel in the morning and you will go on a tour to discover amazing islands between 10 AM and 4 PM. Your driver will then bring you back to your hotel in Rio.",
